----

= Trust Recommendations =

You DPS — SA / TA / Flee. You need: **tank for TA positioning**, Haste, debuffs.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Stable tank — TA requires standing behind mob relative to tank, August's aggressive enmity holds position</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee (you), full status removal, Convert</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🌹 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Arciela_II">Arciela II</a></strong></td><td>Slow/Paralyze/Dispel on mob + Haste/Refresh on party + nukes</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🥷 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Maximilian">Maximilian</a></strong></td><td>Also uses SA/TA constantly — two thieves do more positional damage than one + generic DPS</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>💃 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Mumor">Mumor</a></strong></td><td>Haste Samba, Stutter Step DEF debuff, Violent Flourish interrupts</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

----

= ⚔️ Main Weapons =

**Note:** At low levels, daggers' low DMG and weak WS make them poor for soloing/early parties. The first dagger WS that works well with SA/TA is **Viper Bite**, so most THFs use Hand-to-Hand or Sword early. **Fast Blade** and **Combo** stack fully with SA, and at low skill rank the difference is small.

== Dagger ==

NIN sub for Dual Wield is most common; WAR before lvl 20, then /NIN 30+ unless going for Berserk. Avoid daggers until 20-33 minimum (Wasp Sting / Shadowstitch still work on SA).

