</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

----

= 🛡️ Armor =

A THF wants two sets: **Acc/Atk** for TP gain, **DEX/AGI** for SATA. Optionally a third for ranged accuracy / status bolts. After 30, defense doesn't matter much (TA transfers hate). 15-29 may need defense gear (SA generates large damage hate; /NIN at 24 fixes it).

